# Location anchor tool (old shell only)

**Mark spots** (`#spotToggle`, `?pins=1` in root `index.html`) places oak standees on the **live** street paintings only.

New location screens use the tabletop placer (`mockups/lythmere-hex-pieces/index.html`): drag pieces on the flat board, Copy `%` slots. See `tabletop-locations.mdc`.

If Marc asks to restage the **live** street screens before the rebuild:

1. Open with `?pins=1`. **Mark spots**.
2. Pins **0–3** (front large → back small). **Copy**, bake CSS, **Hide grid**.
3. Ghosts = Tomas bevel v19. List panel top-right. No per-mousemove CSS rewrites.
